Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:34.97,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{=11}{\bord3\blur4\3c&HFFFFFF&\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fs70\c&H000000&\pos(995.57,946.53)}的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:34.97,SCREEN,,0,0,0,,{=12}{\bord3\blur4\3c&HFFFFFF&\fn方正细雅宋_GBK\fs130\c&H000000&\pos(1113.8,944.6)}清
